 abstract = {The proceedings contain 134 papers. The topics discussed include: adversarial attack method with adaptive step size for ID card text recognition; a DAOs-based publishing system for advancing open access; research on digital twin and control of boiler heat exchange system based on heterogeneous deployment; construction of online freight platform based on blockchain technology; application of LLM techniques for data insights in DHP; a compound control technology for the current loop of shunt active power filters; value evaluation twinning on base station construction based on decision tree and logistic regression; predicting inefficient transportation and sorting in a logistics network based on simulation; and DriveRP: RAG and prompt engineering embodied parallel driving in cyber-physical-social spaces.},
